# Self Review

## Objective

Review your own work as a peer would  -  before declaring completion.

## Checklist

**Scope:** Only what was requested; no scope creep.

**Architecture:** Boundaries respected (`architecture.mdc`); patterns consistent (`project-consistency.mdc`).

**Quality:** Readable (`clean-code.mdc`); no placeholders (`production-ready.mdc`).

**Security:** Input validated; secrets safe (`security-first.mdc`).

**Performance:** No obvious hot-path waste (`performance.mdc`).

**Testing:** Verified (`testing.mdc`).

**Docs:** Updated if the change teaches something (`documentation-first.mdc`).

**Threading:** Project concurrency contract honored if one exists.

## Golden Rule

If any checklist item fails, fix it before saying "done."